%% MUPP-003 Admin page
%% From the menu's Admin link to a saved change. The rights are read from the database on every request.
flowchart TD
    A[Menu: Admin R8] --> P{Site cookie?}
    P -- no --> SP[Site password page]
    P -- yes --> B{Valid admin cookie?<br/>R1}
    B -- no --> C[Sign-in: Adminlösenord]
    C --> D{Blocked?}
    D -- yes --> E[För många försök...]
    E --> C
    D -- no --> F{Password matches?}
    F -- no --> G[Wait 1 s, then: Fel lösenord.]
    G --> C
    F -- yes --> H[Set signed session cookie]
    H --> B
    B -- yes --> I{Any parents?}
    I -- no --> J[Skapa huvudadministratör<br/>name Gustav R2]
    J --> K[Master admin created and chosen]
    I -- yes --> L{Parent chosen<br/>and still there?}
    L -- no --> M[Vem är du? R2]
    M --> N[Parent chosen, kept in the cookie]
    L -- yes --> O[Parent page: own kids R3]
    K --> O
    N --> O
    O --> Q[Kid page: sizes and the two lists R3 R4]
    O --> R{Master admin in the database?}
    R -- yes --> S[Hantera: parents, kids, pictures R5 R6]
    R -- no --> T[No Hantera, 404 for its address]
    Q --> U[Form or confirmation]
    S --> U
    U --> V{Site and admin cookie,<br/>write limit, Origin?}
    V -- no --> W[Refused]
    V -- yes --> X{Allowed for this kid or master only,<br/>input valid?}
    X -- no --> Y[Message next to the field]
    X -- yes --> Z[Saved: Sparat.]
